@startuml
' ============================================
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - Оформление заказа (End-to-End)
' ============================================

actor "Покупатель" as Customer
participant "UI\n(Frontend)" as UI
participant "Saga\nOrchestrator" as Saga
participant "Payment\nService" as Payment
participant "Stock\nService" as Stock
participant "Order\nState Machine" as State
database "База данных" as DB

== Успешный сценарий ==

Customer -> UI: 1. Нажимает "Купить"
activate UI

UI -> Saga: 2. POST /api/orders/create
activate Saga

Saga -> Payment: 3. ProcessPayment(amount)
activate Payment

Payment --> Saga: 4. PaymentSuccess
deactivate Payment

Saga -> State: 5. TransitionTo(Paid)
activate State
State --> Saga: 6. Status changed
deactivate State

Saga -> Stock: 7. CheckStock(productId, quantity)
activate Stock

Stock --> Saga: 8. StockAvailable
deactivate Stock

Saga -> State: 9. TransitionTo(Shipped)
activate State
State --> Saga: 10. Status changed
deactivate State

Saga -> State: 11. TransitionTo(Delivered)
activate State
State --> Saga: 12. Status changed
deactivate State

Saga -> DB: 13. SaveOrder()
activate DB
DB --> Saga: 14. OrderSaved
deactivate DB

Saga --> UI: 15. OrderSuccess
deactivate Saga

UI -> Customer: 16. Показать "Заказ доставлен"
deactivate UI

== Сценарий с ошибкой и компенсацией ==

Customer -> UI: 17. Ошибка при оплате
activate UI

UI -> Saga: 18. POST /api/orders/create (сумма > лимита)
activate Saga

Saga -> Payment: 19. ProcessPayment(amount)
activate Payment

Payment --> Saga: 20. PaymentFailed (лимит превышен)
deactivate Payment

Saga -> State: 21. TransitionTo(Failed)
activate State
State --> Saga: 22. Status changed
deactivate State

note right of Saga
  **ЗАПУСК КОМПЕНСАЦИИ (Saga Pattern)**
  - Возврат средств
  - Отмена резерва товаров
end note

Saga -> Payment: 23. RefundPayment()
activate Payment
Payment --> Saga: 24. RefundSuccess
deactivate Payment

Saga -> Stock: 25. ReleaseStock()
activate Stock
Stock --> Saga: 26. ReleaseSuccess
deactivate Stock

Saga -> State: 27. TransitionTo(Cancelled)
activate State
State --> Saga: 28. Status changed
deactivate State

Saga --> UI: 29. OrderFailed + ErrorMessage
deactivate Saga

UI -> Customer: 30. Показать "Ошибка: превышен лимит"
deactivate UI

@enduml